@startuml CU07_GestionarMetodos
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DefaultFontColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowFontSize 9
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ActorFontStyle normal
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontSize 10
    ParticipantFontStyle normal
}

title CU7. Gestionar métodos y operaciones

actor Editor
participant ClassContextMenu <<View>>
participant CollaborationStompController <<Controller>>
participant Metodo <<Model>>

Editor -> ClassContextMenu : 7. AgregarMetodo(classId)
activate ClassContextMenu
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 7.1 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/lock(ACQUIRE, classId)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 7.2 lockConcedido
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 7.3 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/mutate(ADD_METHOD, classId, payload)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController -> Metodo : 7.4 crear(id, nombre, tipoRetorno, visibilidad, parametros)
activate Metodo
deactivate Metodo
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 7.6 StompBroadcastMessage(ADD_METHOD, payload)
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu --> Editor : 7.7 Muestra el método nuevo en la clase

Editor -> ClassContextMenu : 7.8 EditarMetodo(methodId, cambios)
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 7.9 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/lock(ACQUIRE, methodId)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 7.10 lockConcedido
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 7.11 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/mutate(UPDATE_METHOD, methodId, diff)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController -> Metodo : 7.12 actualizar(methodId, diff)
activate Metodo
deactivate Metodo
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 7.14 StompBroadcastMessage(UPDATE_METHOD, payload)
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu --> Editor : 7.15 Refleja los cambios del método

Editor -> ClassContextMenu : 7.16 EliminarMetodo(methodId)
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 7.17 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/mutate(DELETE_METHOD, methodId)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController -> Metodo : 7.18 eliminar(methodId)
activate Metodo
deactivate Metodo
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 7.20 StompBroadcastMessage(DELETE_METHOD, methodId)
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu --> Editor : 7.21 Quita el método de la clase
deactivate ClassContextMenu

@enduml
